DTSTAMP:20261121T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270126
SUMMARY:Estimated VA ACH Notice Window - January 2027
DESCRIPTION:Informational watch date approximately 8 calendar days before t
 he calculated payment date. A VA notice or pending transaction may appear 
 around this time. This is not the official payment date\, a confirmed ACH 
 transmission date\, or a guarantee that funds are available. Timing varies
  by VA processing and receiving institution.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
